'''Jibbly Studio''' (スタジオニャブリ, ''Sutajio Nyaburi'', '''Studio Nyabli''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after reaching [[User Rank]] 1450.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Power UP (M): Cat Cannon attack power increases by 50%.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Jibbly Studio|Cannon Attack Up (M)|The Flying Cat|Mythical Titan Cat|Witch Cat|jpname=スタジオニャブリ}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This Combo references Studio Ghibli, which is famous for its anime-style animated films. The three cats could refer to some of the first movies of the studio: Mythical Titan Cat could refer to the [[wikia:ghibli:God Warriors|God Warrior]] of the movie [[wikipedia:Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind (film)|''Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind'']], The Flying Cat to [[wikipedia:Castle in the Sky|''Castle in the Sky'']], and Witch Cat to the witch-in-training [[wikia:ghibli:Kiki|Kiki]] from [[wikipedia:Kiki's Delivery Service|''Kiki's Delivery Service'']].

